    {
      "text": "可自定义海怪进化路线，每次选择都会同时改变外形与能力",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Players can customize the evolution path of the sea monster according to their preferences, and each choice will affect the shape and ability of the sea monster.",
